direction: down

ordinary: Ordinary JS, JSX, TS, or TSX
tsrx: TSRX bytes
scan: Linear scan
overlay: Fingerprint overlay
projection: Marked legal TSX projection
markers: One buffer and collision-free IDs
formatter: Oxfmt
arena: One arena AST and one parse
lift: Indexed one-forward-pass lift
formatted: Formatted TSRX

ordinary -> formatter
tsrx -> scan -> projection -> formatter -> lift -> formatted
scan -> overlay -> lift
projection -> markers -> lift
formatter -> arena -> lift
